timestamp "863-07-19T10:00:00Z"
message "Iconoclasm, Solari Sub-surface, Radiant Arms, and Alkahest Freight unite as Team TBD."
body "The morning after Garrick's fall, four powers throw in together under a single\nbanner — borders dissolving where iconoclasm, Solari, Radiant Arms, and Alkahest\nonce held separate ground. The strider learns one new name; the name is not yet\nsettled."

banner-form "team-tbd" name="Team TBD" color="#E8702E" {
    member "iconoclasm"
    member "solari-sub-surface"
    member "radiant-arms"
    member "alkahest-freight"
}
